 ScenarioA;chunks;chunk;words_ok;dist_ok;result;WORDS;DIST;update_thread

⍝ In this scenario, we do simultaneous addition and searching of words.
⍝ As written, the shared WORDS/DIST are updated with no coordination, so threads corrupt one another and the scenario ERRORS partway.
⍝ Use )SIC to clear suspended threads.

 WORDS←''
 DIST←0 0⍴0
 INDEX←WORDS DIST
 JOB←⎕TALLOC 1 'WordSearchQueueTicket'
 RUNNING←1
 update_thread←UpdateLoop&0

 chunks←(∊20⍴⊂40↑1)⊂CORPUS   ⍝ 20 chunks of 40 words each
 :For chunk :In chunks
     {}⎕TSYNC(AddWords&chunk),(Search&¨CORPUS[100?≢CORPUS])   ⍝ Many writers and readers
 :EndFor

 :Repeat
     (WORDS DIST)←INDEX
 :Until WORDS=⍥≢CORPUS

 RUNNING←0

⍝ Check correctness
 words_ok←WORDS≡⍥{⍵[⍋⍵]}CORPUS
 dist_ok←(⍴DIST)≡2⍴≢WORDS
 result←'FAIL' 'PASS'⊃⍨⎕IO+words_ok∧dist_ok
 ⎕←'Words added: ',(⍕≢WORDS),'/',(⍕≢CORPUS)
 ⎕←'⍴DIST: ',⍕⍴DIST
 ⎕←'Scenario A: ',result
